How to use VTY
==============

   To enable VTY inteface, you have to setup vty password.  If there is
no vty password one can not connect VTY inteface at all.

     % telnet localhost 2601
     Trying 127.0.0.1...
     Connected to localhost.
     Escape character is '^]'.
     
     Hello, this is zebra (version alpha-01)
     Copyright 1997 Kunihiro Ishiguro
     
     Vty password is not set.
     Connection closed by foreign host.


